s=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:91e697a8-a5e1-49b6-bdbd-63ac6074bd25\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:91e697a8-a5e1-49b6-bdbd-63ac6074bd25\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Inside a cupboard in <a href=\"/wiki/Tefoco%27s_Home\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tefoco's Home\">Tefoco's Home</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-69&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-106</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This is a battered old handwritten notebook of rules around the house for the family, added to and amended over many years, chore assignments for nine children changing over time as they grow up. The most recent addition is below.]\n</p><p><br>\nGazeba, now that Bubbles is out of the house, you're in charge of making sure all the bed linens are clean and completely changed twice a tenday - three times in the case of Hemjax, that piglet!\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202006\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1604/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29824/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7549/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930679/52428800 by